# AtaProjectCommon

Full text: `/Users/atakanatabey/Projects/Generator/docs/AtaProjectCommon.md`.

Applies to SharedFrame, StockExchange, Varlik360 and CeyizDefterim. Generator's own source is not produced by this rule. The host is the open project root that contains `.generator/manifest.json`.

- Do not hand-write generated admin config, stamped backend files, or a new entity admin screen (page, table, service, route) in those hosts. Change the model, then generate.
- Run `node /Users/atakanatabey/Projects/Generator/scripts/host.mjs admin-config <host> [Entity]` or the same command with `generate`. Same functions as the Electron Generate action. `--dry-run` prints paths and writes nothing.
- Admin UI the config cannot express goes in `packages/admin-base` and is checked with `npm run playground` before a host uses it.
- Still hand-written: `*.generated.ts` (`extendResource`), hooks / custom blocks / `*.Custom.cs`, and non-CRUD pages (login, dashboard, logs, metrics, jobs, screen).
